## 5. 接口定义

### 发牌完成通知
```
broadcast: 'game:dealComplete'
data: { handCards: Card[] }  // 仅发给对应玩家
```

### 叫主
```
emit: 'game:bid'
params: { cards: Card[] }    // 亮出的牌
response: { success, canBid, message }
broadcast: 'game:bidAnnounce' -> { userId, cardCount, suit }
```

### 出牌
```
emit: 'game:play'
params: { cards: Card[] }
response: { success, message }
broadcast: 'game:playAnnounce' -> { userId, cards }
```

### 回合结束
```
broadcast: 'game:roundEnd'
data: { winner, scoreCards, teamScores }
```

